{"id":"n84877-2-8","stage":2,"title":"한때 · 同时","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84877-2-8-1","ko":"가게가 왜 이렇게 복잡해?","zh":"店里怎么这么拥挤啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가게가","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가게가","audio":"/audio/d93ad8ca691832ed80c0.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"복잡해?","meaning":"混乱，混杂，凌乱，拥挤","explanation":"복잡하다：混乱，混杂，凌乱，拥挤；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"복잡하다","audio":"/audio/810e6e796e934adeb9ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66274","senseId":"2","lemma":"복잡하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"복잡해","audio":"/audio/9424cb14d699e1bc5687.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"810e6e796e934ade","term":"복잡하다","zh":"混乱，混杂，凌乱，拥挤","audio":"/audio/810e6e796e934adeb9ba.mp3","entryId":"66274","definition":"某些东西或人挤在一个地方，很杂乱。","pronunciation":["복짜파다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2c5409d12746cba0d5b8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84877-2-8-2","ko":"갑자기 손님들이 한때에 몰려왔어.","zh":"客人突然一下子都涌过来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"손님들이","meaning":"客人，顾客","explanation":"손님：客人，顾客；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"2","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손님들이","audio":"/audio/df232c4273cb94c3d062.mp3"}},{"text":"한때에","meaning":"同时","explanation":"한때：同时；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"한때","audio":"/audio/3b20543b8d3b3cf569ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84877","senseId":"2","lemma":"한때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한때에","audio":"/audio/9b0fb92290e882491d65.mp3"}},{"text":"몰려왔어.","meaning":"聚集；来，来到","explanation":"몰리다：聚集；오다：来，来到；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"몰리다","audio":"/audio/919a152ad89ce04d9f01.mp3"},{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64780","senseId":"3","lemma":"몰리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몰려왔어","audio":"/audio/3f79828cab72e1c1b470.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","